WEBVTT

00:04:59.996 --> 00:05:02.413
and get rid of it or put more money in.

00:05:02.579 --> 00:05:04.413
It even happened in his marriage.

00:05:04.454 --> 00:05:08.913
I probably hung on longer than I
should have went through years

00:05:08.913 --> 00:05:11.329
and years of marital therapy.

00:05:11.621 --> 00:05:15.538
Barry, in a moment like that, do you not
realize you're in an escalation trap?

00:05:15.829 --> 00:05:23.371
I realize I'm in it, but I still realize
that it is a very difficult situation.

00:05:23.371 --> 00:05:28.038
And maybe I can tell myself
it might be a lie,

00:05:28.454 --> 00:05:33.538
that this might be one of the exceptions
in which it actually might be rational